# [MBONED](../wg/mboned.html)

## Summary
The MBONED Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered status updates on active working group documents, industry operational reports on Multicast Adaptive Bit-Rate (MABR) deployments, distribution of AI model weights using IP multicast, proposals for native browser multicast APIs, enhancements to the Linux kernel Automatic Multicast Tunneling (AMT) relay, BGP-based dynamic multicast tunneling, Forward Error Correction (FEC) over Media over QUIC (MoQ), and a summary of the SQUAD BoF.

