### SQUAD BoF Recap
*Presented by Max Franke*  
*Slides:* [SQUAD recap](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-mboned-squad-recap-00)

* **Overview:** Summarized discussions from the SQUAD (Secure QUIC Any-source/Source-specific Delivery) BoF.
* **Key Points:** Strong engagement from the transport community. Discussions centered around whether one-to-many distribution should be integrated into QUIC core transport or handled at higher layers, and whether the scope should expand beyond IP multicast to include generic one-to-many mechanisms (e.g., BIER, packet replication, Flexicast).
* **Next Steps:** Working group chairs and ADs will establish a dedicated `squad` mailing list to continue technical discussion.

